com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGJpQQ4jMNaAc1-hTAWb4P6k1rq3GZsNNfP_ykOXRiu4A&oe=6A79DD84"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "VideoThumbnail.png", "id": "397066162476470", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982484_397066165809803_814656131862562727_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BOdN6i8-DjAQ7kNvwHY-Ogw&_nc_oc=AdrgewarlBG7B3ZOwubj_j5s-NbPsGkiePuQZQl0ZaZJ0VSREk9Ch_1KW06UO-suRdg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGrsskiY1Dx77hujlbRwlv79ZUd4M4T92ZhYCsiwJN1kA&oe=6A79DB92"}, "display_name": "3D Mahjong worlds - Quest", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the VR implementation of the classic Mahjong game\n\nNo matter if you are a mahjong master or a beginner, this game will be your best choice!\nCreative design of solid 3D mahjong levels, simple game rules, suitable for everyone!\nIt\u2019s transformed from the traditional matching game and brings a relaxing experience to players in a 3D way.\nBe the master and pair all the cubes to eliminate them on over 30 levels!\n\nGame features:\n\n- Classic and 3D style levels.\n- Rotate, move and zoom the board.\n- It\u2019s a simple puzzle game which is suitable for any age group.\n", "short_description": "This is the VR implementation of the classic Mahjong game\n\nNo matter if you are a mahjong master or a beginner, this game will be your best choice!\nCreative design of solid 3D mahjong levels, simple game rules, suitable for everyone!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://pixelbrainstudio.com/privacy/oculus/privacy_policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pixelbrain Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.pixelbrainstudio.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "377